// 2026-10-22 DUAL WIELD: the off-hand copies (DECORATE.aedual AE_Off_* : <gun>_3D) drew as the
// TC's 2D sprites because MODELDEF binds models to the EXACT class name and this engine does not
// inherit a parent's blocks. Every block of each base gun, copied for its off-hand class
// (generated from the pack's own modeldef files; regenerate if those change).

